<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST FALL AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST FALL AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates fell</p>
<p>slightly at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate fell to 3.32 percent.</p>
<p>					Sept 12 fix	    Sept 11 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.24 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.27 pct		3.28 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.32 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.47 pct		3.48 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.60 pct		3.62 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.71 pct		3.72 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
